  "details": "Yes I know this was an issue before, but it's back. The \"Clear Content Cache\" button does not work again after another vrchat update. Please understand my frustrations with this because I only have access to the quest version and i can only have 4gb loaded before everything breaks. This issue last time took weeks to fix and it was a great annoyance to not only me but many of my friends as well.\n\n1. Open VRC\n\n2. Go to debug menu\n\n3. Click clear content cache\n\n4. Close, then reopen game\n\n5. Cache didnt clear",
